  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:continuation id="F_ca9b3b54-7c7e-4088-9778-2bc351b363c9_3" continuedAt="F_ca9b3b54-7c7e-4088-9778-2bc351b363c9_4"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">MBIA Inc. and Subsidiaries</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements (Unaudited)</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Note 7: Investments (continued)</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Gross unrealized losses on AFS investments increased as of June 30, 2026 compared with December 31, 2025 primarily due to higher interest rates.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">With the weighting applied on the fair value of each security relative to the total fair value, the weighted average contractual maturity of securities in an unrealized loss position as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> was </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_94277efd-91b6-4b22-8c97-4f92d6356d94" contextRef="C_d8b85a68-edad-4537-81fa-f719fa1e67ad" name="mbi:WeightedAverageContractualMaturityPeriodOfSecuritiesUnrealizedLossPosition" format="ixt-sec:duryear"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">12</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_c98ba635-07c8-4dd3-92b8-481643715a1f" contextRef="C_51959f95-0dcb-4c04-a454-6ad727792334" name="mbi:WeightedAverageContractualMaturityPeriodOfSecuritiesUnrealizedLossPosition" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">14 years</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, respectively. As of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, there were </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_8311dab6-f20b-4cb1-a595-8d17f3302641" contextRef="C_7f2f029e-8564-463d-8d33-540e743f8bb2" name="mbi:InvestmentSecuritiesInUnrealizedLossPositionsQualitativeDisclosureNumberOfPositionsForContinuousTwelveMonthPeriod" unitRef="U_Security" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">236</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7e9e51f3-54e1-4f5b-9e86-df9abbf959f1" contextRef="C_62ce0fe8-f3cf-4a1d-95e1-7c7e20849d75" name="mbi:InvestmentSecuritiesInUnrealizedLossPositionsQualitativeDisclosureNumberOfPositionsForContinuousTwelveMonthPeriod" unitRef="U_Security" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">247</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> securities, respectively, that were in an unrealized loss position for a continuous twelve-month period or longer, of which, fair values of </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_e7a3b430-e3aa-4b13-804a-2f6149bce87d" contextRef="C_19c6cc71-49fb-44ee-a024-0809cdb4b382" name="mbi:InvestmentSecuritiesInUnrealizedLossPositionsQualitativeDisclosureNumberOfPositionsForContinuousTwelveMonthPeriod" unitRef="U_Security" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">208</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_11a0cd0d-bcf3-4e38-ac18-c8247fa39d0c" contextRef="C_c7fcab3a-647a-4e4b-abbc-8c3a70e3357d" name="mbi:InvestmentSecuritiesInUnrealizedLossPositionsQualitativeDisclosureNumberOfPositionsForContinuousTwelveMonthPeriod" unitRef="U_Security" decimals